{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your automotive empire and leave your mark on history.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the founder of your own car brand at the dawn of the 20th century, in a rapidly changing world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters: innovation, production, and the global economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your name become a legend\u2026 or fade into history?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937770/extras/47da50565b89380de57b896e60df6c64.poster.avif?t=1770731781\" width=1102 height=539 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937770/extras/47da50565b89380de57b896e60df6c64.webm?t=1770731781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Design unique cars</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create and customize every detail of your vehicles:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compact city cars, luxury sedans, or sports models</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-house developed engines or licensed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Historical options and emerging technologies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each model reflects your vision\u2026 and meets market demand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937770/extras/bf7e7b97adcfdca1b87554c34d5ee3f1.webp?t=1770731781\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937770/extras/bf7e7b97adcfdca1b87554c34d5ee3f1.poster.avif?t=1770731781\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=658 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage your factories</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and upgrade your production sites around the world:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire and manage your workforce</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust wages and working conditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize productivity and quality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to a constantly evolving economic and social world</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Efficient management is the key to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937770/extras/a58c8be047defb441999acac94b1e3ee.poster.avif?t=1770731781\" width=970 height=561 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937770/extras/a58c8be047defb441999acac94b1e3ee.webm?t=1770731781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Research &amp; Technologies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invest in a deep technology tree featuring over 150 technologies:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engine components</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comfort and luxury features</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanical and industrial innovations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay ahead of your time\u2026 or let your competitors leave you behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937770/extras/0a353f94675eadafd11b25cbae578960.webp?t=1770731781\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937770/extras/0a353f94675eadafd11b25cbae578960.poster.avif?t=1770731781\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=658 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A dynamic global economy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world is divided into 20 geographic regions, each with its own:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Population and wage levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique car preferences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demand that evolves over the decades</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the right car, in the right place, at the right time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for car enthusiasts, <strong>Papercars Tycoon</strong> puts you in control of your very own automotive empire.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3937770?t=1770731781","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3937770?t=1770731781","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937770/6160a225f654f69424559963002696e1ec445ae7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770731781","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937770/6160a225f654f69424559963002696e1ec445ae7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770731781","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4040490,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your automotive empire and leave your mark on history.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the founder of your own car brand at the dawn of the 20th century, in a rapidly changing world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters: innovation, production, and the global economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your name become a legend\u2026 or fade into history?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop p